  "body": "Defines a tiered compliance model for organisms that cannot instantiate a full file-backed VCW cube (web-only LLM environments, serverless runtimes):\r\n\r\n- Tier 1 (Full): Python + filesystem; audit.py passes. Default.\r\n- Tier 2 (Structural): Python, no persistent fs; conforming adapter backend.\r\n- Tier 3 (Schema-only): no runtime; correct blueprint + human checklist.\r\n\r\nKey rule: an undeclared fake VCW is a hard fail; a declared constraint (via VCW_BACKEND in \u00a70) is a valid, honest state.\r\n\r\nFiles changed:\r\n- docs/Mantle_VCW_Tiers.md (new): full tier model, VCWBackend contract, Tier 3 deliverable checklist, immune enforcement rules\r\n- docs/Mantle_LLM_Pitfalls.md: Trap 2 now names Tier 3 as the correct answer for web-only environments; Pre-Work Checklist gains question 6\r\n- Mantle_Part1_Body.md \u00a71.1: VCW_BACKEND added to \u00a70 declaration instructions\r\n- README.md + Mantle_PRIMER.md: VCW_Tiers added to reading-order trees; PRIMER pitfalls callout points to tiers doc for no-Python environments\r\n\r\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01A7Ey1MaGtWrix2DhdXxX4i",
